# This port is a FreeLinX-native GPT writer; it is NOT built from NetBSD source,
# so there is no upstream archive or checksum to pin.  It exists because the
# portable tools for the job are GPL and the FreeLinX flxpart that shipped in
# the rootfs template was a static GCC binary with no source anywhere.
